This zip contains the full catalyst tree with the anti-drift architecture applied
and version bumped to 0.5.0.

plugins/repository/catalyst-git/ appears here as regular files (checked out at
e4095f4, catalyst-git v0.3.0). In a real git clone this is a submodule linked via
.gitmodules. If you turn this zip back into a working git repo, re-establish the
submodule rather than committing these files directly:

    git submodule update --init --recursive

